    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc01_0280_system_01",
      "hash64": "9A47009BB4E2CD15",
      "text": "今天要休息了吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0280_system_02",
      "hash64": "9A46FD9BB4E2C7FC",
      "text": "第二天……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0280_student1_01",
      "hash64": "088E136CA2287378",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，早上好。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0280_student1_02",
      "hash64": "088E166CA2287891",
      "text": "丹瑜让我给你传话，\\n她在家里等你，\\r\\n让你快点过去。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0280_student1_03",
      "hash64": "088E156CA22876DE",
      "text": "她扔下同一组的我，\\n却把你邀请到家里……\\r\\n你们是什么关系？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0280_student2_01",
      "hash64": "0752CB677B1ADDCF",
      "text": "昨天管理员给我看了\\n一个特别棒的面具。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0280_student3_01",
      "hash64": "31D0DF5C31B2501A",
      "text": "你都找完所有介绍牌了！？\\n好快，太厉害啦！\\c\\n和我一组的姐姐怕我不舒服，\\n所以我们找得很慢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0280_bbteacher_01",
      "hash64": "4E67221DF8A82D5C",
      "text": "有的学生还没完成\\n定向越野。\\c\\n一边等待，一边自由地\\n享受在北上的时光吧。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
